---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Mark from '../components/Mark.astro';
import ContactSection from '../components/ContactSection.astro';

const embers = [
  [30, 4, 'spark', 7, 30, -360, -1], [45, 3, 'ember', 6, -40, -320, -3],
  [58, 5, 'spark', 8, 50, -400, -5], [70, 3, 'ember', 6.6, -20, -340, -2],
] as const;
---
<Base
  title="Our Story — Broken Frame Strategies"
  description="Fifteen years watching businesses fix the wrong thing — and why Broken Frame Strategies does one thing: brand narrative."
>
  <section id="top" class="hero">
    <Nav current="story" />

    <div class="wrap hero-copy">
      <div class="mono spark kicker"><Mark size={16} stroke={3} />Our Story</div>
      <h1 class="title">
        <span>“Humans <span class="spark">think in stories</span>, and we try to make sense of the world by telling stories.”</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="quote-by mono">— Yuval Noah Harari</p>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section id="story" class="wrap story-wrap">
    <article class="story">
      <div class="fuse-track" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="fuse"></span>
        <span class="fuse-tip"><span class="tip"></span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="body">
        <p>I’ve spent over 15 years in startups, agencies, tech, and crypto. But the most important thing I ever learned didn’t come from any of that.</p>
        <p>There is a truth that is hiding in plain sight: That the world is made up of stories.</p>
        <p>Your career, your relationships, and even your sense of who you are. Nearly everything that we think is real is actually just a story.</p>
        <p>Once I truly understood that, it changed my life.</p>
        <p>So I went all in. I studied story structure and narrative obsessively, then turned it toward the one place I knew best: Business. Since then, I’ve helped founders of all kinds make their story conscious, own it, and use it to scale.</p>
        <p>And I’m still amazed by how many brilliant businesspeople obsess over campaigns and tactics while their biggest problem is glaring right back at them: A lackluster story.</p>
        <p>That’s why I love this work. I teach clients that story isn’t decoration, it’s strategy, and the leverage point that matters above everything else.</p>
      </div>


    </article>

    <figure class="portrait">
      <div class="portrait-inner">
        <span class="bf" aria-hidden="true" style="--w: 3px; inset: -28px 28px 28px -28px">
          <span class="h" style="top: 0; left: 0; right: 0"></span><span class="v" style="top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0"></span><span class="v" style="top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 150px"></span><span class="h" style="bottom: 0; left: 150px; right: 0"></span>
          <span class="k brk-load" style="bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 134px; height: 134px; border-bottom: var(--w) solid var(--c); border-left: var(--w) solid var(--c); transform: translate(-30px, 36px) rotate(9deg); transform-origin: 0 100%"></span>
        </span>
        <div class="portrait-crop">
          <img src="/robert.jpg" alt="Robert, founder of Broken Frame Strategies, at a Buddhist temple surrounded by colourful prayer flags" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="client">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="h-xl client-title">Client <span>Success</span></h2>
      <p class="client-sub">Helping founders turn their story into growth they can see.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap client-body">
    <div class="client-row">
      <img class="client-logo" src="/images/ting-therapeutics.png" alt="Ting Therapeutics" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <figure class="client-quote">
        <blockquote>“Robert helped me find the heart of my own story. Across my founder’s story, brand narrative, and pitch deck, he brought what mattered most into focus, and now people lean in every time I tell it.”</blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mono">— Jian Zuo</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ContactSection />

  <div class="embers send-off" aria-hidden="true">
    {embers.map(([l, s, c, d, x, y, dl]) => (
      <span class="ember" style={`left: ${l}%; width: ${s}px; height: ${s}px; background: var(--${c}); --d: ${d}s; --x: ${x}px; --y: ${y}px; animation-delay: ${dl}s`}></span>
    ))}
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; }
  .hero-copy { padding-top: 110px; }
  .ghost { top: 40px; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgba(243,234,224,0.08); }
  .kicker { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .quote-by { margin: 28px 0 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: rgba(243,234,224,0.7); }
  .title { position: relative; margin: 0; max-width: none; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 72%; font-size: clamp(45px, 6.25vw, 100px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.025em; }

  .story-wrap { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; gap: 64px clamp(40px, 6vw, 96px); max-width: 1240px; }
  .story-wrap .story { flex: 1 1 520px; margin: 0; max-width: 680px; }
  .portrait { flex: 0 1 380px; margin: 0; padding-top: 60px; }
  .portrait-inner { max-width: 380px; margin-left: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .portrait { flex-basis: 100%; } .portrait-inner { max-width: 340px; } }
  .portrait-inner { position: relative; margin-left: 8%; }
  .portrait-inner { max-width: 360px; }
  .portrait-crop { position: relative; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; }
  .portrait img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 60% 30%; transform: scale(2); transform-origin: 50% 42%; }

  .story-wrap { padding-top: 180px; padding-bottom: 120px; }
  .story { position: relative; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 64px; }
  .fuse-track { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 8px; bottom: 8px; width: 2px; background: rgba(243,234,224,0.12); }
  .fuse { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--line), var(--ember) 70%, var(--spark)); }
  .fuse-tip { position: absolute; left: 1px; top: 100%; display: block; width: 0; height: 0; }
  .tip {
    position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; display: block; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--spark); box-shadow: 0 0 18px 6px rgba(255,160,50,0.6); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  .opener { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 34px); line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .dim { color: rgba(243,234,224,0.7); }
  .pull { margin: 120px -18% 120px 0; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 70%; font-size: clamp(44px, 5.6vw, 84px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
  .pull-spark { margin-top: 80px; font-size: clamp(46px, 6.4vw, 96px); color: var(--spark); }
  .body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.65; color: rgba(243,234,224,0.88); }
  .body p { margin: 0; }
  .belief { position: relative; padding: 52px 52px 56px; }
  .belief p { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 30px); line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .sign { margin: 64px 0 0; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: rgba(243,234,224,0.75); }
  .sign-cta { margin-top: 40px; }

  .send-off { position: relative; height: 160px; }
  .client {
    background: var(--bone); color: var(--ink); padding-top: 140px; padding-bottom: 140px;
    clip-path: polygon(0 70px, 18% 22px, 19.5% 56px, 47% 0, 49% 30px, 76% 14px, 100% 52px, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
  }
  .client-title { font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 96px); color: var(--accent); }
  .client-title span { color: var(--accent); }
  .client-sub { margin: 28px 0 0; font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 26px); line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(14,11,12,0.8); max-width: 34ch; }
  .client-body { margin-top: 80px; }
  .client-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 64px clamp(40px, 6vw, 96px); }
  .client-logo { flex: 0 0 210px; width: 210px; height: auto; }
  .client-quote { margin: 0; flex: 1 1 480px; max-width: 640px; }
  .client-quote blockquote { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 30px); line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
  .client-quote figcaption { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 26px; color: rgba(14,11,12,0.7); }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .client-logo { flex-basis: 100%; width: 150px; } }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero-copy { padding-top: 56px; }
    .kicker { margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .portrait { margin-top: 72px; }
    .portrait-inner { margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 0; }
    .portrait .bf { inset: -16px 16px 16px -16px !important; }
    .story-wrap { padding-top: 110px; padding-bottom: 80px; }
    .story { padding-left: 28px; }
    .pull { margin: 72px 0; }
    .pull-spark { margin-top: 56px; }
    .body { font-size: 18px; }
    .belief { padding: 36px 24px 40px; }
  }
</style>
